{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>炎明熹今日現身《2026年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》記者會，一改以往乖乖女甜美形象，以極度破尺度的性感造型驚艷 …</p><p></p>\n<p>炎明熹今日現身《2026年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》記者會，一改以往乖乖女甜美形象，以極度破尺度的性感造型驚艷全場。她不但憑藉這個大膽穿搭成為全場鎂光燈焦點，更因為入圍叱咤女歌手金獎大熱名單而掀起網上連番罵戰。這場關於樂壇天后寶座爭奪戰背後牽扯出一段意想不到激烈恩怨。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹性感抹胸疊穿工裝褲展現破格魅力</h2>\n<p>記者會現場星光熠熠，炎明熹以一頭招牌烏黑長直髮配搭齊瀏海強勢亮相，身上那件藍黑色低胸抹胸上衣完美展露其纖細腰線。她下身更巧妙地利用深灰色格仔百褶短裙疊搭寬鬆工裝長褲，褲身上飾有大型金屬鏈條與口袋，腳踏一雙黑色厚底鞋，將Y2K街頭潮流與成熟性感風格完美融合。這身型格打扮完全顛覆了她昔日清純少女模樣，成功吸引現場所有鏡頭瘋狂捕捉。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹無懼鏡頭捕捉大擺俏皮姿勢搶盡風頭</h2>\n<p>面對現場閃光燈狂閃與媒體緊迫盯人，炎明熹毫不怯場，反而顯得非常風騷自信。她在台上大方舉起雙手擺出各種俏皮姿勢，將青春活力與冷酷性感完美結合，與其一身型格打扮形成強烈視覺對比。她在記招上的輕鬆自若態度，不僅展現出大將之風，更令全場見證了這位新生代歌手在形象蛻變上的強大駕馭能力。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹首度衝擊女歌手金獎迎擊三大強敵</h2>\n<p>隨著頒獎典禮逼近，商台播放率最高女歌手名單亦成為各界關注焦點。今年共有4位從未奪得叱咤女歌手金獎候選人角逐最高殊榮，當中炎明熹憑藉強勁播放率強勢入圍，成為奪獎大熱門之一。有網民更特意發起網絡投票測試水溫，吸引多達2,165名樂迷參與投票，她與實力派歌手泳兒等人在榜單上鬥得難分難解！</p>\n<h2>樂迷湧入留言區齊撐神曲《風旅》</h2>\n<p>網絡上支持聲音絡繹不絕，大批網民紛紛湧入社交平台留言打氣。有網民熱烈表示「全力支持Gigi 炎明熹希望叱吒攞到金獎」，亦有粉絲抱持平常心稱「支持炎明熹，攞到什麼獎都會戥佢開心」及「有獎攞就OK㗎啦」。除了女歌手獎項外，更有樂迷針對具體歌曲提出期望，直指「最想Gigi得到至尊歌曲獎，『風旅』空靈感非常喜愛的」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377553232054737_3529078996aead7ad65567.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 叱咤頒獎典禮 （圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377553232054737_3529078996aead7ad65567.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377553780690918_10879197546aead7b214c45.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 叱咤頒獎典禮 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377553780690918_10879197546aead7b214c45.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377554162569840_1875629256aead7b62dc1c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 叱咤頒獎典禮 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377554162569840_1875629256aead7b62dc1c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377554497314265_14524101956aead7b967bcb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 叱咤頒獎典禮 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377554497314265_14524101956aead7b967bcb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377554904974803_5365536206aead7bd599ed.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 叱咤頒獎典禮 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377554904974803_5365536206aead7bd599ed.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/gigi-%e7%82%8e%e6%98%8e%e7%86%b9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gigi 炎明熹</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%b1%e5%92%a4%e9%a0%92%e7%8d%8e%e5%85%b8%e7%a6%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叱咤頒獎典禮</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e6%ad%8c%e6%89%8b%e9%87%91%e7%8d%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女歌手金獎</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：YouTube@商業電台 Hong Kong Toolbar、IG@yiminghay資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535848\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:49.873554+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1354,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:59:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:49.944479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:49.944479+00:00","content_hash":"58f1739d0aeee20ca259e1c5b0fba1be7e0c6a2496d6b1cfdeb6325c41af9a5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}